le was created by the macro 'cc_grpc_library', the error might have been caused by the macro implementation in /gpfs/home/chaowei/download/bazel/tools/build_rules/genproto.bzl:104:18.\nINFO: Found 1 target...\nERROR: /gpfs/home/chaowei/download/bazel/src/main/tools/BUILD:26:1: C++ compilation of rule '//src/main/tools:build-runfiles' failed: gcc failed: error executing command \n(cd /tmp/bazel.alRY7gp4/out/bazel && \\\nexec env - \\\nPATH=/gpfs/home/chaowei/software/python-3.4.3/bin:/gpfs/home/chaowei/software/jdk1.8.0_91/bin:/gpfs/home/chaowei/software/gcc-4.8.4/bin:/gpfs/mpicomplier/compiler/impi/4.1.0.024/intel64/bin:/gpfs/mpicomplier/compiler/composer_xe_2013.1.117/bin/intel64:/gpfs/mpicomplier/compiler/composer_xe_2013.1.117/mpirt/bin/intel64:/gpfs/mpicomplier/compiler/composer_xe_2013.1.117/bin/intel64:/gpfs/mpicomplier/compiler/composer_xe_2013.1.117/bin/intel64_mic:/gpfs/mpicomplier/compiler/composer_xe_2013.1.117/debugger/gui/intel64:/gpfs/lsf/9.1/linux2.6-glibc2.3-x86_64/etc:/gpfs/lsf/9.1/linux2.6-glibc2.3-x86_64/bin:/opt/xcat/bin:/opt/xcat/sbin:/opt/xcat/share/xcat/tools:/opt/xcat/bin:/opt/xcat/sbin:/opt/xcat/share/xcat/tools:/usr/lib64/qt-3.3/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/sbin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/opt/ibutils/bin:/root/bin:/usr/lpp/mmfs/bin:/root/bin:/gpfs/home/chaowei/bin \\\n/gpfs/home/chaowei/software/gcc-4.8.4/bin/gcc -U_FORTIFY_SOURCE '-D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=1' -fstack-protector -Wall -Wl,-z,-relro,-z,now -B/gpfs/home/chaowei/software/gcc-4.8.4/bin -B/usr/bin -Wunused-but-set-parameter -Wno-free-nonheap-object -fno-omit-frame-pointer '-std=c++0x' -iquote . -iquote bazel-out/local-fastbuild/genfiles -iquote external/bazel_tools -iquote bazel-out/local-fastbuild/genfiles/external/bazel_tools -isystem external/bazel_tools/tools/cpp/gcc3 -no-canonical-prefixes -fno-canonical-system-headers -Wno-builtin-macro-redefined '-D__DATE__=\"redacted\"' '-D__TIMESTAMP__=\"redacted\"' '-D__TIME__=\"redacted\"' '-frandom-seed=bazel-out/local-fastbuild/bin/src/